<node id="claim_pt_tunes_her_mechanism">
  <data key="d21">MechanismClaim</data>
  <data key="d22">Single-atom platinum in Pt/np-Co0.85Se optimizes the surface states of Co0.85Se active centers, reduces the energy barriers of water dissociation, and improves hydrogen adsorption/desorption behavior, thereby promoting hydrogen evolution thermodynamics and kinetics.</data>
  <data key="d34">electronic-structure and kinetic mechanism</data>
  <data key="d35">Single-atom platinum in Pt/np-Co0.85Se optimizes the surface states of Co0.85Se active centers, reduces the energy barriers of water dissociation, and improves hydrogen adsorption/desorption behavior, thereby promoting hydrogen evolution thermodynamics and kinetics.</data>
  <data key="d36">mixed</data>
  <data key="d23">Mechanistic interpretation explicitly attributed to combined operando X-ray absorption spectroscopy and density functional theory calculations.</data>
  <data key="d24">["claim_pt_tunes_her_mechanism"]</data>
  <data key="d25">1</data>
</node>
